tegory":"Seafood","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Cocktail Bars","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cajun/Creole, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"Udkoo_WdRpHtVAWbALCvjw","review_id":"he1C6Yrd4VAThdINzzGfng","date":"2016-10-09T06:49:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.946742057800293,"text_excerpt":"This place is so delish when it comes to seafood. I ate brunch here on my birthday and it was so yummy (they have bottomless mimosas!!). We had the crawfish & crab beignets (which are a must try), I also had the fried green tomato eggs Benedict, and a bloody mary that was way tastier than expected. The only item I would advise against was the pecan pie, which tasted a bit stale and lacked flavor, but this is a seafood restaurant, not a bakery. Overall the experience, service, and food was great and I will be back!"},{"business_id":"Udkoo_WdRpHtVAWbALCvjw","review_id":"DzuPeCA1P1VPySfrmU8Dbw","date":"2013-12-26T21:13:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9398437142372131,"text_excerpt":"Great seafood, untouched by a fry batter, in New Orleans usually isn't cheap. Enter Basin. I will preface my review by saying a friend is part owner, but he knows I don't like him much anyway, so I'll be honest here and not flatter them too too much. ;) If a friend's in town with an expense account or no budget and want's to treat you to a New Orleans seafood dinner, this is your jam. Go all out with signature cocktails, apps, and entrees for the full experience. As an entree, I've had Kay Kay's BBQ Shrimp, not a first date meal since it's head-on, but the right amount of spice for this spicy lady. If you're looking to maximize your budget, do this (what I did this past Monday). Head in o..."},{"business_id":"Udkoo_WdRpHtVAWbALCvjw","review_id":"AU5xAyJ3EwzjJgzQdFETZg","date":"2016-07-03T21:59:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9376840591430664,"text_excerpt":"Had the most delicious crab and crawfish beignets at a Happy Hour last week. This was my first trip to New Orleans so our host insisted we go and check them out. Needless to say we didn't really have to eat dinner as a few orders of those filled us up, along with our champagne. Great place to duck in out of the afternoon shower while out shopping."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Udkoo_WdRpHtVAWbALCvjw","photo_id":"lbhwH2gGcAV7bG_oROUCOA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/lbhwH2gGcAV7bG_oROUCOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8790768384933472},{"business_id":"Udkoo_WdRpHtVAWbALCvjw","photo_id":"m55ugxqJ5pgGvYnPJP4v5g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/m